From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivo Nunes <ivo@nunes.uk>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:40:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tvOS: each Apple TV user's own data

Apple TV can have several users. Without the user-management
entitlement, a game shares one set of data and one keychain between
all of them. The tvOS export now has an Entitlements > User Management
option, set by default to runs-as-current-user-with-user-independent-
keychain: each user gets their own data and keychain, and a keychain
shared by the household sits beside them (Purr keeps remembered guests
there, so they're shared across users).

The shared Apple embedded exporter writes the entitlement when a
preset has the option, which only the tvOS exporter declares.

Test: export for tvOS and check the Xcode project's .entitlements file
has com.apple.developer.user-management with the chosen value.

Not upstream yet; worth proposing with #118332.
---
 .../editor/export/editor_export_platform_apple_embedded.cpp  | 5 +++++
 godot/platform/tvos/export/export_plugin.cpp                 | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/godot/editor/export/editor_export_platform_apple_embedded.cpp b/godot/editor/export/editor_export_platform_apple_embedded.cpp
index 00102452..2133823f 100644
--- a/godot/editor/export/editor_export_platform_apple_embedded.cpp
+++ b/godot/editor/export/editor_export_platform_apple_embedded.cpp
@@ -525,6 +525,11 @@ String EditorExportPlatformAppleEmbedded::_process_config_file_line(const Ref<Ed
 		if ((bool)p_preset->get("entitlements/increased_memory_limit")) {
 			entitlements += "<key>com.apple.developer.kernel.increased-memory-limit</key>\n<true/>\n";
 		}
+		// tvOS only (its exporter declares the option).
+		const String user_management = p_preset->get("entitlements/user_management");
+		if (!user_management.is_empty()) {
+			entitlements += "<key>com.apple.developer.user-management</key>\n<array>\n<string>" + user_management + "</string>\n</array>\n";
+		}
 		entitlements += p_preset->get("entitlements/additional").operator String() + "\n";
 
 		strnew += p_line.replace("$entitlements_full", entitlements);
diff --git a/godot/platform/tvos/export/export_plugin.cpp b/godot/platform/tvos/export/export_plugin.cpp
index 5a3de81e..a141d1a9 100644
--- a/godot/platform/tvos/export/export_plugin.cpp
+++ b/godot/platform/tvos/export/export_plugin.cpp
@@ -57,6 +57,8 @@ void EditorExportPlatformTVOS::get_export_options(List<ExportOption> *r_options)
 	EditorExportPlatformAppleEmbedded::get_export_options(r_options);
 
 	r_options->push_back(ExportOption(PropertyInfo(Variant::STRING, "application/min_tvos_version"), get_minimum_deployment_target()));
+	// Each Apple TV user gets their own data, with a keychain shared by the household beside it.
+	r_options->push_back(ExportOption(PropertyInfo(Variant::STRING, "entitlements/user_management", PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM, ",runs-as-current-user,runs-as-current-user-with-user-independent-keychain"), "runs-as-current-user-with-user-independent-keychain"));
 
 	// Each tvOS app icon is a parallax image stack with its own layers. The back layer
 	// falls back to the project icon; unset middle and front layers are emitted transparent.
